  <wpt lat="30.228000" lon="79.615000"><ele>2430</ele><name>Wan / Kanol Roadhead Trailhead</name><desc>Historic Garhwali hamlet with ancient Latu Devta temple.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.245000" lon="79.660000"><ele>3350</ele><name>Ali Bugyal &amp; Bedni Bugyal High Meadows</name><desc>Among the grandest alpine meadow pastures in Asia with direct views of Mount Trishul.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.252000" lon="79.695000"><ele>4300</ele><name>Kalu Vinayak Shrine</name><desc>Ancient black stone Ganesha shrine marking entry to the high snow zone.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.258000" lon="79.715000"><ele>4660</ele><name>Bhagwabasa Glacial Moraine High Camp</name><desc>Last windswept rocky camp in stone huts beneath Roopkund.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="30.261700" lon="79.731500"><ele>5029</ele><name>Roopkund Mystery Skeleton Lake</name><desc>Enigmatic high-altitude tarn containing 9th-century human skeletal remains beneath the sheer wall of Trishul.</desc></wpt>
